Usage: tsci push [options] [file]

Save package code to Registry API

Arguments:
  file                 Path to the package file

Options:
  --version-tag <tag>  Publish as a non-latest version using the provided tag
  --include-dist       Include the dist directory in the push
  --compress           Compress project files into a single archive upload for
                       faster pushes (default)
  --no-compress        Upload project files individually without compression
  -h, --help           display help for command
